  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PACER PLUS II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The New Zealand Government is providing a five-year contribution to support Pacific PACER Plus members to implement PACER Plus and increase utilisation of the agreement, including development of goods exports, services exports, and support of an investment-friendly environment. This funding includes support of the PACER Plus Development and Economic Cooperation work programme, as well as bespoke assistance by New Zealand Inc agencies.</narrative>
  </description>
